From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tatsuki Tanaka <tatsuki@tanakatatsuki.dev>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 11:33:37 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: codecs: aw88261: don't dereference missing profile
 names

prof_name_list (or an entry of it) can be NULL depending on the ACF
firmware, and the profile enum info callback then strscpy()s from a NULL
pointer, oopsing in snd_ctl_elem_info (e.g. 'amixer contents') with the
card controls lock held. Report such entries as missing instead.

---
 sound/soc/codecs/aw88261.c | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/sound/soc/codecs/aw88261.c b/sound/soc/codecs/aw88261.c
index 679c99a00a..ff0545ec8c 100644
--- a/sound/soc/codecs/aw88261.c
+++ b/sound/soc/codecs/aw88261.c
@@ -445,6 +445,9 @@ static int aw88261_dev_get_prof_name(struct aw_device *aw_dev, int index, char *
 
 	prof_desc = &aw_dev->prof_info.prof_desc[index];
 
+	if (!prof_info->prof_name_list || !prof_info->prof_name_list[prof_desc->id])
+		return -EINVAL;
+
 	*prof_name = prof_info->prof_name_list[prof_desc->id];
 
 	return 0;
